WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.190
I want to start today with genuinely just
very good news, you might remember that last

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:14.110
week on Monday, we learned that Pfizer reported
that their vaccine in their data is shown

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:18.680
to be 90 percent effective at preventing coronavirus
infections.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:23.339
It was not yet peer reviewed this morning,
just hours ago.

00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:30.730
Moderna, based here in Boston, says that its
vaccine is ninety four point five percent

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.710
effective in preventing covid-19.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:42.289
This is interim data from a late stage clinical
trial data on which they will be seeking immediate

00:00:42.289 --> 00:00:47.539
emergency use, authorization to start vaccinating
people.

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:52.949
And we are very quickly pointed in the direction,
of course, pending those approvals of the

00:00:52.949 --> 00:01:01.760
U.S. having two vaccines authorized for emergency
use by December with as many as 40 to 60 million

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:07.570
doses available and being distributed by the
end of this year.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:15.100
Medicine, as interim analysis was based on
ninety five infections among participants

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:19.300
who received either the placebo or a vaccine.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:26.690
Of those 95 people who got the virus, only
five had received the vaccine.

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.140
The other 90 had received a placebo.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.420
In other words, not the vaccine.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:37.060
This was with the two doses 28 days apart,
as is expected to be the sort of eventual

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:39.560
protocol for this vaccine.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:45.100
Also very important, the data from modern
US thirty thousand participant trial showed

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:51.000
that the people who got the vaccine and got
coronavirus, in other words, that roughly

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.340
five percent who, despite having the vaccine
were not completely protected, seemed to have

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:00.860
significantly less serious cases of coronavirus.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.080
So that's a question that's still in the air
about the Fizer vaccine.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:09.160
One of the other major differences between
the Moderna and the Fizer vaccine is that

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:16.360
unlike the Fizer vaccine, the Moderna vaccine
requires only standard refrigeration.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:21.860
One of the issues with the Fizer vaccine was
that it requires refrigeration well below

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:26.890
the temperatures that, like a typical flu
vaccine, might require.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:32.390
And so from an infrastructure standpoint,
the Moderna vaccine also having huge, huge

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.970
promise just as far as the ease of distribution.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:40.040
And it simplifies infrastructure requirements
dramatically.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:47.210
The Fizer vaccine has to be shipped and stored
at minus 70 C 70 Celsius, and that's certainly

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:48.210
a challenge.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.810
So you couldn't ask for better news?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:56.310
Of course, we need to go through the process,
peer reviewing the data, getting that emergency

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:57.490
use authorization.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.220
If you don't trust the FDA, these are vaccines.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:04.020
We now have two vaccines that are going to
be presumably seeking approval in other countries

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.020
as well.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:09.340
So if you trust a different country's health
agency, as you would not be crazy to do during

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:16.410
a time when the FDA and CDC have been so politicized
by the Trump administration, you will have

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:20.290
presumably approvals from other countries
as well, at least before the vaccine is widely

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.190
available to people of all ages.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:30.250
And I think it makes sense to mention it does
not seem like these companies and from what

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:37.700
I've seen, the Moderna CEO to me has always
seemed like a guy on the up and up the development

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.560
in Germany with biotech and this Turkish immigrant.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:46.080
Couple of the what is now being called the
Pfizer vaccine.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:51.710
So far, the point I'm trying to make is I've
not seen evidence that either of these individuals

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:56.350
are running organizations that would try to
get approval for their vaccine before it was

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.350
ready.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.640
Trump wanted them to do it as quickly as possible.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:03.020
Trump said 100 million doses in October.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:06.220
And I would have been worried if that had
happened because it seemed like it would have

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.580
been too soon.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:11.650
December, based on the data we now have, seems
logical.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:13.760
And that's sort of where my head is right
now.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.360
Now, I want to mention one other thing.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.540
You start doing the math, OK?

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:22.660
If we have two vaccines, 60 million doses
in December, you need two doses.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:26.500
So that would be like for 30 million people,
that's only 10 percent, nine percent of the

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.600
country.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:32.510
And then maybe you get another total for thirty
five million people in January if you start

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.510
doing math.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:36.850
And it seems like it's going to be a long
time before any of us will be able to get

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:37.930
a vaccine.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:42.840
The latest surveys indicate that 40 percent
of the country doesn't have any plan to get

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.100
this vaccine.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:47.690
Now, that represents potential herd immunity
issues.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:54.660
But separately, remember, if 40 percent of
the country doesn't want the vaccine, 400

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.940
million doses would be enough for everybody
who wants the.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:06.040
Scene to get both doses that they need 28
days apart, so the point is it's bad that

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:10.520
40 percent of the country doesn't want the
vaccine from a herd immunity standpoint.

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:18.141
You and I, if you are in sort of my demographic
sort of position, age and health range, you

00:05:18.141 --> 00:05:24.590
and I may be able to get a vaccine far sooner
as a result of having hopefully two approved

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.761
vaccines and 40 percent of the country not
wanting it.

00:05:27.761 --> 00:05:29.460
It does raise longer term questions, though.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:32.800
About 40 percent of the country not wanting
the vaccine.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.030
We have a possible game changer here.

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.100
Let's not get ahead of ourselves.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:41.800
We've seen Foushee on vaccine timeline be
more optimistic lately than we've ever seen

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.800
him.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:47.430
And if things go the way they are pointing,
we could have a second half of twenty twenty

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.430
one.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.650
That looks dramatically better than 20/20.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:54.310
I don't want to make any more hyperbolic claim
than that.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.930
I'm not even thinking of things like completely
back to normal.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:02.990
But in the meantime, masks, distancing, not
having huge indoor Thanksgivings.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:07.620
All of those things have to continue because
we're back up to fifteen hundred people a

00:06:07.620 --> 00:07:20.099
day dying.

